      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Inside the FastRAG box",
      "items": [
        "FastAPI API (Vercel function or Docker), the website and operator console (Next.js), and offline scripts — see diagram 02",
        "The corpus is FastRAG's own repo: scripts/ingest-self.py walks a local checkout with git ls-files; citations link to GitHub at the indexed commit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Configured, not always used",
      "items": [
        "Cloud profile: Jina + Groq, OpenRouter fallback before the first token only",
        "Local profile: FastEmbed ONNX models and Ollama on the host",
        "ElevenLabs STT and Langfuse tracing are opt-in"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Boundary controls",
      "items": [
        "Bearer query key / admin key; frontends inject a server-only token",
        "Unauthenticated: /health/*, /metrics, FastAPI /docs",
        "No inbound rate limiting in app or proxy"
      ]
